{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 44, :comments ["<b>And in their days</b> — the kingdom of the Messiah." "<b>Shall not be left</b> — shall not be forsaken and shall not remain." "<b>All</b> — and the meaning of די לא בידין (that it is not by hand): not by might and not by power, but from itself, at the time of the end."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:19:27.207446600Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}